Month = {NOV},
Abstract = {Recent media controversy surrounding the acceptance and publication of
   an article from Israeli-based academics in Political Geography raises
   serious questions concerning academic boycotts and ideas of academic
   freedom. This short article provides some brief background at efforts to
   boycott Israeli academic institutions and outlines some of the issues
   surrounding the appropriateness of such boycotts in general and of
   Israel in particular. More specifically it examines the issues of
   academic freedom, and the equity, effectiveness and flexibility of
   academic boycotts. (c) 2005 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.},
